#CoQ9 ligand, 0KT with final product ubiquinone
pair_coeff 11 20 lj/cut 1.2 11 27.5
pair_coeff 12 20 lj/cut 1.2 11 27.5
pair_coeff 13 20 lj/cut 1.2 11 27.5
pair_coeff 14 20 lj/cut 1.2 11 27.5
